commit 67ae7ce76a5f96c9e17fe0af5b6571b58fef0769
Author:     Henry Cikanek <cikanekhenry@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: 2025-11-04
Commit:     GitHub <noreply@github.com>
CommitDate: 2025-11-05

    feat(chatbot): Fix race conditions and chat state bugs [EVO-2435]
    
    - Implement smart chat deletion behavior that creates new chat when deleting active conversation
    - Fix race condition where messages appeared in wrong chat during rapid switching
      - Add requestChatIdRef and currentActiveChatIdRef to track chat IDs accurately
      - Conditionally update UI based on current active chat while always saving to history
    - Add background message sync to display completed messages when returning to chat
      - Prevent stale backend data from overwriting newer local messages
      - Sync messages from chatHistory when activeChatId changes
    - Implement instant title updates in sidebar when smart titles arrive from backend
      - Track title changes using refs to trigger conversation list refetch
    - Fix React key prop warning in ChatHistorySidebar by using conversationId with fallbacks
    - Remove manual refetchConversation call to prevent 404 errors on chat deletion
    
    These changes ensure messages persist correctly across chat switches and improve overall UX reliability.

